sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant P as provision.sh
    participant SSM as Parameter Store
    participant CERT as CloudFormation (us-east-1)
    participant R53 as Route 53
    participant ECR as ECR
    participant CFN as CloudFormation (ap-south-1)

    Dev->>P: deploy/provision.sh [allowed CIDRs]
    P->>SSM: get or create /mcp-post-pilot-infra/origin-secret
    opt custom domains set in deploy/config.env
        P->>CERT: deploy certificate stack (ACM, DNS validation)
        CERT->>R53: validation CNAME records
        CERT-->>P: certificate ARN once issued
    end
    alt functions already exist
        P->>P: reuse the image tag CI last deployed
    else first run
        P->>CFN: create stack with no image (ECR repositories only)
        P->>ECR: push images, or reuse ones the workflow already pushed
    end
    P->>CFN: deploy stack (Lambdas, DynamoDB, S3, CloudFront, edge function, DNS records, CI policy)
    CFN->>R53: A alias records for blog-app and agent-chat
    CFN-->>P: outputs (URLs, function names, bucket, distribution)
    P-->>Dev: outputs table
